# CHANGELOG.md — merge only (NON-NEGOTIABLE)

`CHANGELOG.md` `[Unreleased]` is cumulative. **Never rewrite or
replace the whole section.** Agents have wiped ButtonGroup /
Attached / bench-doc entries by pasting a fresh Unreleased block —
that must not happen again.

## When adding changelog notes

1. **Read** the current `[Unreleased]` first (`git show HEAD:CHANGELOG.md`
   and the working tree).
2. **Insert** new bullets under the right subsection (Added / Changed /
   Fixed / Removed / Renamed). Keep every existing bullet unless the
   user explicitly asks to drop it.
3. **Never** `Write` the full changelog from a partial draft. Prefer
   surgical edits (`StrReplace` / patch) that only touch the lines you
   are adding or correcting.
4. If you must regenerate prose for one entry, **diff against HEAD**
   afterward and restore any removed Unreleased bullets before
   finishing.
5. When syncing `site/docsapp/data/CHANGELOG.md`, copy **after** the
   merge is complete — never the other way around as a source of truth.

This outranks convenience. Prefer a messy merge over a clean wipe.
